{"id":"bofetada","lemma":"bofetada","pos":"noun","rank":4873,"glosses":["a slap in the face"],"ipa":"/bofeˈtada/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bofetadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-bofetada.wav","examples":[{"text":"Le dio una bofetada.","en":"She gave him a slap in the face.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645388","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Le pegué una bofetada.","en":"I slapped him.","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to stick","l":"pegar"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"En un momento de rabia, Tom le dio una bofetada a Mary.","en":"In the heat of the moment, Tom slapped Mary.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806153","words":[{"g":"in / on"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"rage, anger"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"one second"]]},{"text":"Si Mary le dio una bofetada a Tom, estoy segura de que se lo merecía.","en":"If Mary slapped Tom, I'm sure he deserved it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801939","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},null,{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"secure","l":"seguro"},null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to deserve","l":"merecer"}],"phrases":[[10,12,"that"]]}]}